    "reason": "The question asks how the 'fatty' composition of myelin sheaths enhances neuronal function (likely via insulation). The admitted facts discuss astrocytes, microglia, complement proteins, thrombospondins, and general neurotransmission mechanisms. None of these facts explain the biophysical link between fatty composition and enhanced function."
  }
